        "original_id": "8aac4995-c1a3-5454-9131-deaf46cb15bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Heavy Gear, Heavy Gear II\n- Companies: Activision, Loki Software, Dream Pod 9\n- Platforms: Microsoft Windows, Linux\n- Concepts: Heavy Gear universe, Heavy Gear role-playing game\n\nFacts:\n- Heavy Gear is a 1997 computer game based on the Heavy Gear role-playing game.\n- Heavy Gear II is a sequel to the 1997 video game Heavy Gear.\n- Heavy Gear II was set in Dream Pod 9's Heavy Gear universe and was developed and published by Activision in 1999 for Microsoft Windows.\n- Loki Software ported Heavy Gear II to Linux in 2000.",
